re **not** evidence about whether $\\mathcal{S}(x) = s + \\Gamma^{\\perp}$ for a series genuinely spread over $\\mathbb{R}^{n}$ with $n \\ge 2$, a question this library does not settle ([[rem-rn-conventions-and-scope]]).",
